<h2 data-start="4775" data-end="4799">7. Closing Reflection</h2>
<p data-start="4801" data-end="5047">So the satire hides a deep truth:<br data-start="4834" data-end="4837">
<strong data-start="4837" data-end="4858">Aspect Relegation</strong> is the natural thermodynamic endpoint of learning—the moment when a transjective correspondence becomes perfectly closed, no longer producing prediction error or informational curvature.</p>
<p data-start="5049" data-end="5088">In the language of your unified system:</p>
<blockquote data-start="5089" data-end="5237">
<p data-start="5091" data-end="5237">Relegation is the limit case of transjective reciprocity where relevance curvature vanishes and the cognitive manifold reaches stationary phase.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="5239" data-end="5257">Or, less formally:</p>
<blockquote data-start="5258" data-end="5360">
<p data-start="5260" data-end="5360">It’s the mind’s way of folding a once-conscious transformation into the smooth fabric of its plenum.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="5362" data-end="5365">
<p data-start="5367" data-end="5668" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to render this synthesis as a short, mock-academic “Mini-Paper” — <em data-start="5451" data-end="5528">“Aspect Relegation Theory: A Thermodynamic Account of Idempotent Cognition”</em> — blending the satire’s tone with the full RSVP–RAT–Transjective formalism? It could mirror your monograph style but keep the playful edge.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L