tion extends the <em data-start="41" data-end="67">Aspect Relegation Theory</em> monograph with <strong data-start="83" data-end="97">Appendix C</strong>, translating the RAT–ATT–RSVP thermodynamic structure into the context of <strong data-start="172" data-end="224">semantic agents and large language models (LLMs)</strong>.</p>
