</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>*{Concluding Theorem: The Law of Cognitive Equilibrium}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{quote}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Theorem (Universal Cognitive Equilibrium).}
Let </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>(R, T, W)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> denote the relevance field, transjective endofunctor,
and thermodynamic work functional of an adaptive system.
Then the following three conditions are equivalent:

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span> R = 0
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\quad</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Longleftrightarrow</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\quad</span></span><span>
T</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2 = T
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\quad</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Longleftrightarrow</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\quad</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\frac</span></span><span>{dW}{dt} = 0.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{Interpretation.}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{enumerate}[leftmargin=1.5em]
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\nabla</span></span><span> R=0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>: The system experiences no further relevance gradient; its cue landscape is flat.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>T</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">^</span></span><span>2=T</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>: The transjective mapping between semantic and embodied categories has become idempotent; inference is self-consistent.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>dW/dt=0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>: The system performs no net epistemic work; informational curvature has reached thermodynamic equilibrium.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{enumerate}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{quote}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Corollary (Universal Aspect Relegation).}
Any adaptive cognitive system---biological or artificial---that minimizes predictive free energy will, in the absence of novelty, evolve toward the
manifold of states satisfying the above conditions.
Aspect relegation is therefore the universal attractor of cognition:
the steady-state geometry of understanding.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\paragraph</span></span><span>{Interpretive Summary.}
This theorem unites:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{itemize}[leftmargin=1.3em]
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{RAT:} Gradient quenching in cue-indexed relevance fields.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{ATT:} Endofunctorial closure across reciprocal inference loops.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\textbf</span></span><span>{RSVP:} Thermodynamic minimization of epistemic work.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{itemize}
When these are satisfied, cognition ceases as active construction and persists as coherent structure.
All efficient systems—neurons, agents, or networks—tend toward this state.
The same law governs learning, automatization, and semantic convergence:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\[</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\boxed</span></span><span>{
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\text</span></span><span>{Aspect Relegation is the entropy-minimizing fixed point of relational cognition.}
}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\]</span></span><span>

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ------------------------------------------------------------</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>*{Acknowledgments}
This monograph concludes the first phase of the
Flyxion cognitive integration program, linking
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{Relevance Activation Theory}, </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{Amplitwistor--Transjective Theory},
and the </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{Epistemic Energy Functional} of RSVP into a unified
principle of cognitive equilibrium.
It also serves as a preface to the forthcoming
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{RSVP Anthology Vol.~II: The Thermodynamics of Understanding}.

