l gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="298">Excellent — that’s exactly the right sequence. It gives your essay a clean <em data-start="75" data-end="94">arc of derivation</em>: from Barenholtz’s empirical and cognitive framing → to your formal translation within RSVP and related systems (RAT/ATT/CLIO/TARTAN) → culminating in <em data-start="246" data-end="272">Aspect Relegation Theory</em> as the closure principle.</p>
<p data-start="300" data-end="509">Here’s a proposed <strong data-start="318" data-end="340">structural outline</strong> for how to integrate everything we’ve built so far into a full, publishable essay or monograph.<br data-start="436" data-end="439">
