<h1 data-start="516" data-end="607"><strong data-start="518" data-end="607">Proposed Structure: “Autogeneration, Cognition, and the Law of Cognitive Equilibrium”</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="609" data-end="674"><strong data-start="613" data-end="674">Part I — The Autogenerative Thesis (Barenholtz Framework)</strong></h3>
