<ol data-start="752" data-end="2187">
<li data-start="752" data-end="951">
<p data-start="755" data-end="802"><strong data-start="755" data-end="802">Introduction: The Autogenerative Hypothesis</strong></p>
<ul data-start="806" data-end="951">
<li data-start="806" data-end="863">
<p data-start="808" data-end="863">Language and cognition as self-constructing processes</p>
</li>
<li data-start="867" data-end="904">
<p data-start="869" data-end="904">Autogeneration vs. autoregression</p>
</li>
<li data-start="908" data-end="951">
