"0" data-end="87">Excellent — here’s the plan for execution before we start writing actual LaTeX content:</p>
<hr data-start="89" data-end="92">
<h2 data-start="94" data-end="134"><strong data-start="97" data-end="134">Build Plan for the Full Monograph</strong></h2>
<p data-start="136" data-end="395">We’ll structure it as a modular LaTeX project, using your established academic aesthetic (TeX Gyre Termes, microtype, geometry, section titles, and in-line commentary spacing).<br data-start="312" data-end="315">
