break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="155">Excellent — that’s the best way to keep it reviewable and editable.<br data-start="67" data-end="70">
Here’s the plan for the multi-part delivery of <strong data-start="117" data-end="154"><code data-start="119" data-end="152">part1_autogenerative_thesis.tex</code></strong>:</p>
<hr data-start="157" data-end="160">
<h3 data-start="162" data-end="183"><strong data-start="166" data-end="183">Delivery Plan</strong></h3>
<p data-start="185" data-end="369"><strong data-start="185" data-end="211">Part 1 → Sections 1–10</strong><br data-start="211" data-end="214">
Foundations: definition of autogeneration, non-Markovian autoregression, trajectory geometry, energy functionals, and information-geometric interpretation.</p>
<p data-start="371" data-end="530"><strong data-start="371" data-end="398">Part 2 → Sections 11–25</strong><br data-start="398" data-end="401">
Advanced frameworks: ergodic theory, category theory, differential geometry, rough paths, sheaf theory, and operadic composition.</p>
<p data-start="532" data-end="707"><strong data-start="532" data-end="574">Part 3 → Sections 26–40 + Bibliography</strong><br data-start="574" data-end="577">
Quantum-informational, renormalization, derived-geometric, and cohesive ∞-topos synthesis leading to the final unified conjecture.</p>
