fect — I’ll keep <strong data-start="20" data-end="69">global numbering for all theorem environments</strong> and <strong data-start="74" data-end="109">equations numbered sequentially</strong> across the document (no section resets), matching the format you use in <em data-start="182" data-end="201">RSVP Field Theory</em> and <em data-start="206" data-end="236">Unistochastic Quantum Theory</em>.</p>
