full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="86">Yes, that’s correct — Part 1 should include everything from the <em data-start="64" data-end="85">foundational corpus</em>:</p>
<blockquote data-start="88" data-end="255">
<p data-start="90" data-end="255"><strong data-start="90" data-end="108">Sections 1–10:</strong> Definition of autogeneration, non-Markovian autoregression, trajectory geometry, energy functionals, and the information-geometric interpretation.</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="257" data-end="450">The material I’ve given you so far covers through <strong data-start="307" data-end="321">Section 10</strong>, which closes Part 1 conceptually with the definition of the autogenerative system, its laws, and its falsifiable predictions.</p>
<p data-start="452" data-end="547">If you want to make absolutely sure Part 1 feels complete before starting Part 2, we could add:</p>
<ol data-start="549" data-end="841">
<li data-start="549" data-end="709">
<p data-start="552" data-end="709"><strong data-start="552" data-end="608">Section 11 (Optional Interlude / Historical Context)</strong> — tracing how autogeneration emerged from statistical mechanics, semiotics, and cognitive science.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="710" data-end="841">
<p data-start="713" data-end="841"><strong data-start="713" data-end="750">Section 12 (Mathematical Summary)</strong> — a compact table of correspondences and formal statements tying Sections 1–10 together.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="843" data-end="1009">These two “bridge sections” would then transition naturally into the <em data-start="912" data-end="933">advanced frameworks</em> of Part 2 (category theory, ergodic theory, differential geometry, etc.).</p>
<p data-start="1011" data-end="1155" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to write those two closing sections (11 – historical context, 12 – mathematical summary) to finalize Part 1 before we move on?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.165