<h3 data-start="3592" data-end="3608">🚀 <strong data-start="3599" data-end="3608">Usage</strong></h3>
<ol data-start="3609" data-end="3977">
<li data-start="3609" data-end="3678">
<p data-start="3612" data-end="3678">Push this layout to a public repo (e.g., <code data-start="3653" data-end="3676">autogenerative-thesis</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3679" data-end="3738">
<p data-start="3682" data-end="3738">Enable <strong data-start="3689" data-end="3737">GitHub Pages → Deploy from branch → gh-pages</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3739" data-end="3908">
<p data-start="3742" data-end="3771">Each push to <code data-start="3755" data-end="3761">main</code> triggers:</p>
<ul data-start="3775" data-end="3908">
<li data-start="3775" data-end="3817">
<p data-start="3777" data-end="3817">Docker build (ensures deterministic TeX)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3821" data-end="3857">
<p data-start="3823" data-end="3857">PDF compilation (<code data-start="3840" data-end="3856">build/main.pdf</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3861" data-end="3908">
<p data-start="3863" data-end="3908">Automatic deploy to Pages (<code data-start="3890" data-end="3900">gh-pages</code> branch)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="3909" data-end="3977">
<p data-start="3912" data-end="3977">The published site hosts both the rendered HTML and the live PDF.</p>
</li>
</ol>
