<h3 data-start="3744" data-end="3765">✅  How it behaves</h3>
<ol data-start="3767" data-end="4285">
<li data-start="3767" data-end="3798">
<p data-start="3770" data-end="3798">Push any commit to <code data-start="3789" data-end="3795">main</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3799" data-end="3863">
<p data-start="3802" data-end="3863">GitHub Actions runs the workflow, builds the PDF in Docker.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3864" data-end="3967">
<p data-start="3867" data-end="3967">The job uploads that same file both as a build artifact and as <code data-start="3930" data-end="3964">public/autogenerative_thesis.pdf</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3968" data-end="4048">
<p data-start="3971" data-end="4048">The deploy step publishes everything in <code data-start="4011" data-end="4020">public/</code> to the <code data-start="4028" data-end="4038">gh-pages</code> branch.</p>
</li>
