<p data-start="303" data-end="473">Below I’ll give <strong data-start="319" data-end="345">every file’s full text</strong> so you can drop them into a folder and run <code data-start="389" data-end="413">python3 zip_builder.py</code> to make your final <code data-start="433" data-end="472">autogenerative-thesis-&lt;timestamp&gt;.zip</code>.</p>
