<li data-start="7841" data-end="7896">
<p data-start="7844" data-end="7896">Run <code data-start="7848" data-end="7863">bash build.sh</code> — compiles the PDF via Docker.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="7897" data-end="7983">
<p data-start="7900" data-end="7983">Run <code data-start="7904" data-end="7928">python3 zip_builder.py</code> — produces a distributable zip including everything.</p>
</li>
