<p data-start="736" data-end="861">→ produces <code data-start="747" data-end="786">autogenerative-thesis-&lt;timestamp&gt;.zip</code><br data-start="786" data-end="789">
→ push that zip or unpack it to GitHub → automatic PDF + Pages build.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="863" data-end="866">
<p data-start="868" data-end="939">Before I output the <strong data-start="888" data-end="907">raw bundle text</strong>, just confirm two quick things:</p>
<ol data-start="941" data-end="1205">
<li data-start="941" data-end="1073">
<p data-start="944" data-end="1073">Do you want <strong data-start="956" data-end="983">bibliography references</strong> (<code data-start="985" data-end="1002">thebibliography</code> or <code data-start="1006" data-end="1012">.bib</code> + <code data-start="1015" data-end="1022">biber</code>) included in this zip so the PDF compiles fully?</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1074" data-end="1205">
<p data-start="1077" data-end="1205">Should I include <strong data-start="1094" data-end="1150">placeholder LaTeX for the remaining sections (15–25)</strong> so the structure is complete but content marked “TBD”?</p>
