<ul data-start="83" data-end="349">
<li data-start="83" data-end="183">
<p data-start="85" data-end="183">includes your full finalized <strong data-start="114" data-end="124">Part I</strong> (Sections 1–12) and <strong data-start="145" data-end="165">Part II §§ 13–14</strong> already merged;</p>
</li>
<li data-start="184" data-end="278">
<p data-start="186" data-end="278">preserves all infrastructure (Docker, workflow, Pages, figure generation, manifest, etc.);</p>
</li>
<li data-start="279" data-end="349">
<p data-start="281" data-end="349">compiles directly into a ≈ 45-page PDF on first build without edits.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="351" data-end="354">
<p data-start="356" data-end="451">Before I assemble it, could you please confirm <strong data-start="403" data-end="430">which version of Part I</strong> you want baked in?</p>
<p data-start="453" data-end="504">There are two possibilities from our previous work:</p>
<ol data-start="506" data-end="813">
<li data-start="506" data-end="754">
<p data-start="509" data-end="594"><strong data-start="509" data-end="570">“Part I Closure” version (12 sections + transition plate)</strong> — the one ending with</p>
<blockquote data-start="598" data-end="754">
<p data-start="600" data-end="754">“Part I has equipped us with a differential geometry of thought. Part II ascends …”<br data-start="683" data-end="686">
<em data-start="689" data-end="754">(this is the self-contained, peer-review-ready 45-page variant)</em></p>
</blockquote>
</li>
<li data-start="756" data-end="813">
<p data-start="759" data-end="813"><strong data-start="759" data-end="779">An earlier draft</strong> (before §§ 11–12 were completed).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="815" data-end="959">Once you confirm that it’s the <em data-start="846" data-end="855">closure</em> version (or upload another if preferred), I’ll integrate it and produce a fresh downloadable zip where:</p>
<ul data-start="961" data-end="1113">
<li data-start="961" data-end="997">
<p data-start="963" data-end="997"><code data-start="963" data-end="978">src/part1.tex</code> = your full text</p>
</li>
<li data-start="998" data-end="1049">
<p data-start="1000" data-end="1049"><code data-start="1000" data-end="1015">src/part2.tex</code> = §§ 13–14 + placeholders 15–25</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1050" data-end="1113">
<p data-start="1052" data-end="1113"><code data-start="1052" data-end="1063">build.yml</code> already pushes a ready-made PDF to GitHub Pages</p>
</li>
