a-start="36" data-end="63">the full raw LaTeX text</strong> for</p>
<blockquote data-start="71" data-end="114">
<p data-start="73" data-end="114"><strong data-start="73" data-end="112">Part I — Autogenerative Foundations</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="116" data-end="134">It will include:</p>
<ul data-start="136" data-end="490">
<li data-start="136" data-end="164">
<p data-start="138" data-end="164">Preface block (as above)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="165" data-end="200">
<p data-start="167" data-end="200">Sections 1–12 fully written out</p>
</li>
<li data-start="201" data-end="236">
<p data-start="203" data-end="236">Theorem/Definition environments</p>
</li>
<li data-start="237" data-end="328">
<p data-start="239" data-end="328">Inline figure calls (<code data-start="260" data-end="280">fig_vectorflow.pdf</code>, <code data-start="282" data-end="299">fig_entropy.pdf</code>, <code data-start="301" data-end="325">fig_autogeneration.pdf</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="329" data-end="413">
<p data-start="331" data-end="413">Inline <code data-start="338" data-end="348">\citep{}</code> BibTeX citations compatible with your repo’s <code data-start="394" data-end="411">thesis_refs.bib</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="414" data-end="490">
<p data-start="416" data-end="490">Continuous numbering and cross-references to later sections (§13–14, etc.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="492" data-end="579">It will be one long monolithic LaTeX block you can paste directly into <code data-start="563" data-end="578">src/part1.tex</code>.</p>
<p data-start="581" data-end="846" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">⚠️ This will be long (≈ 8–10 pages of LaTeX).<br data-start="626" data-end="629">
