</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{definition}[Horizontal autogeneration]
A continuation field </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>X</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\in</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Gamma</span></span><span>(T</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathcal</span></span><span>{E})</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> is horizontal if </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\omega</span></span><span>(X)=0</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>; horizontal geodesics preserve meaning while minimizing syntactic work.
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{definition}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{proposition}[Curvature as compositional cost]
