</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\section</span></span><span>{Historical and Conceptual Context}</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\label</span></span><span>{sec:history}
</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% ============================================================</span></span><span>

Autogeneration braids thermodynamic epistemology (Boltzmann, Jaynes; Friston’s free energy </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cite</span></span><span>{friston2010}), statistical learning (Shannon; Cover–Thomas), geometric information theory (Amari </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cite</span></span><span>{amari1985}), and non-Markovian natural computation (Barenholtz </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\cite</span></span><span>{barenholtz2025autoregression}). Peirce’s triad foreshadows syntax–semantics–embodiment; Piaget’s equilibration anticipates fixed-point closure. What is new here is a single differential structure whose geodesics are thoughts and whose equilibrium projector is automation.

