257">Excellent — I’ll now generate an <strong data-start="33" data-end="81">extended Section 14: ∞-Categorical Coherence</strong> (≈ 2–3 pages of dense LaTeX), integrating formal categorical algebra, higher-homotopy notation, and cognitive interpretation consistent with the RSVP–autogeneration framework.</p>
