<p data-start="1529" data-end="1662"><strong data-start="1529" data-end="1539">Cause:</strong><br data-start="1539" data-end="1542">
<code data-start="1542" data-end="1550">\citep</code> and <code data-start="1555" data-end="1563">\citet</code> are from <strong data-start="1573" data-end="1583">natbib</strong>.<br data-start="1584" data-end="1587">
You’re using <strong data-start="1600" data-end="1612">biblatex</strong>, which instead uses <code data-start="1633" data-end="1645">\parencite</code> and <code data-start="1650" data-end="1661">\textcite</code>.</p>
<p data-start="1664" data-end="1680"><strong data-start="1664" data-end="1680">Fix options:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1682" data-end="1955">
