se-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="196">Those “environment undefined” errors mean your theorem-like environments were never declared before <code data-start="100" data-end="118">\begin{document}</code>.<br data-start="119" data-end="122">
Here’s exactly what to fix, so you don’t get those cascading errors again.</p>
<hr data-start="198" data-end="201">
<h3 data-start="203" data-end="262">🩹 1. Declare all theorem environments in your preamble</h3>
<p data-start="264" data-end="339">Add this before <code data-start="280" data-end="298">\begin{document}</code> — ideally right after you load <code data-start="330" data-end="338">amsthm</code>:</p>
