<h2 data-start="3482" data-end="3517">✅ <strong data-start="3487" data-end="3517">Why this version is better</strong></h2>
<ul data-start="3519" data-end="3825">
<li data-start="3519" data-end="3554">
<p data-start="3521" data-end="3554">No <code data-start="3524" data-end="3533">|| true</code> masking of errors.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3555" data-end="3590">
<p data-start="3557" data-end="3590">Clear logging under <code data-start="3577" data-end="3587">out/logs</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3591" data-end="3631">
<p data-start="3593" data-end="3631">Portable (runs on Linux, macOS, CI).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3632" data-end="3666">
<p data-start="3634" data-end="3666">Automatically detects <code data-start="3656" data-end="3663">biber</code>.</p>
