down prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="157">Excellent question — this is where most large LaTeX projects (especially multi-part monographs like yours) go wrong if the directory structure isn’t clear.</p>
<p data-start="159" data-end="278">Let’s fix that with a <strong data-start="181" data-end="208">canonical directory map</strong> that matches how <code data-start="226" data-end="235">latexmk</code> and <code data-start="240" data-end="247">biber</code> will expect to see your files.</p>
